  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Real 4WD Fun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Four-wheel drive gives the CyberBrick 4WD Car the grip to feel like a real RC build, not a shelf model. Its compact layout is designed for faster, more responsive driving than the earlier 4x4 Mini Off-Roader platform."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Smoother Handling"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Double wishbone independent suspension helps each wheel react cleanly over uneven surfaces. That means better control, smoother movement, and a more satisfying build for anyone who cares about mechanics."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Smarter Lighting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Separate headlight and indicator control adds a more realistic driving feel after assembly. Use the recommended transparent PETG lighting profile to get the clearest effect from the CyberBrick LEDs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "CyberBrick App Connection Tutorial"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "*The following is the App connection of CyberBrick Official SoccerBot as an example, which is similar to this model."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Core Safety Rules"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This product is intended for users aged 14 and above. Users under the age of 14 must be under direct adult supervision throughout use."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT touch the moving parts while the device is operating to prevent pinching injuries."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Please use only official tools for any firmware operations. Flashing with third-party tools is not supported and may cause irreversible damage, which is not covered by warranty."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Before use, inspect all 3D-printed parts and sand down any sharp edges or burrs if present. Store the model and small parts in a location out of reach of children and pets to prevent choking hazards."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Warning of Lithium Battery"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This product utilizes a replaceable rechargeable lithium battery."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Adult supervision is required when children are handling batteries or the charger. Do not operate the product while it is charging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Ensure the battery is installed correctly. Improper installation may result in short circuits, overheating, or potential explosion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Regularly inspect the charger’s cord, plug, housing, and other components for damage. If any damage is found, discontinue use immediately until the device is fully repaired."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Choking Hazard: Contains small parts; not suitable for children under 3 years of age."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Improper disposal of this product may harm the environment - please recycle responsibly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Charging Precautions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Use only the officially supplied charger. The charger is not a toy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The USB charger for this product only supports standard 5V 1-2A input. Please always use the original charger that meets the voltage/current requirements, or charge directly via a computer USB port. DO NOT use chargers with output higher than 5V or 2A (such as mobile fast chargers, 9V/12V adapters, etc.), as this may cause device damage, overheating, or even serious fire hazards."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT cover the device while charging, and keep it away from high temperature, humidity, or flammable environments. Never charge the device unattended."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT charge the battery pack if it is overheating. Allow it to cool down completely before recharging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "If the battery pack or charger becomes wet, ensure they are thoroughly dry before attempting to charge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Lithium Battery Safety Precautions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT attempt to use or charge the battery pack if it shows any signs of leakage or corrosion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT disassemble, crush, or mechanically abuse the battery pack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT dispose of the battery pack in fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Exercise extreme caution when handling an overheated battery pack."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\">\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Real 4WD Fun</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"module-content\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Four-wheel drive gives the CyberBrick 4WD Car the grip to feel like a real RC build, not a shelf model. Its compact layout is designed for faster, more responsive driving than the earlier 4x4 Mini Off-Roader platform.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/02677234b8f74a80b8ad3f31001648e2/video2.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/02677234b8f74a80b8ad3f31001648e2/video2.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/02677234b8f74a80b8ad3f31001648e2/video2.mp4\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 第2卖点 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Smoother Handling</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Double wishbone independent suspension helps each wheel react cleanly over uneven surfaces. That means better control, smoother movement, and a more satisfying build for anyone who cares about mechanics.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/a6dc8659317a4a93846c1997a4eaf221/video3.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/a6dc8659317a4a93846c1997a4eaf221/video3.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/a6dc8659317a4a93846c1997a4eaf221/video3.mp4\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\">\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Smarter Lighting</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"module-content\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Separate headlight and indicator control adds a more realistic driving feel after assembly. Use the recommended transparent PETG lighting profile to get the clearest effect from the CyberBrick LEDs.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/27bc2a9ba7ae4db79976a4bfed561629/video1.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/27bc2a9ba7ae4db79976a4bfed561629/video1.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/27bc2a9ba7ae4db79976a4bfed561629/video1.mp4\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">CyberBrick App Connection Tutorial</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: -40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em>*The following is the App connection of CyberBrick Official SoccerBot as an example, which is similar to this model.</em></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct